00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:45.350
Was it a challenge building
something to handle all that?

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.390
How did you scale up?

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:47.057
CHANG KIM: Yeah.

00:06:47.057 --> 00:06:50.278
So the scale is indeed a
